*           subroutine and "sudo chmod g+s" all removed, and an adopted or
*           administrator account is never confined to ssh
* 14 Aug 26 Windows port - single quote the pathname passed to OS.EXECUTE,
*           now that !valid_os_path permits spaces
* rev 1.0-1 Jan 26 group account now have linux group name written as lower case
*           with "sdg_" prefix
*           use "adduser" -p parameter when creating linux user account
* rev 0.9-3 Nov 25 move voc back to dynamic file
* rev 0.9.0 Jan 25 mab change dyn file prefix to %
